# Database Rules

Supabase migrations, RLS, auth-linked user data, and Edge Functions are high-risk.

Before changing schema, policies, RPCs, or auth-sensitive queries, read `docs/ai-context/DATA_MODEL.md`, `docs/ai-context/API_CONTRACTS.md`, and relevant migrations.

Do not run production migrations or configure production write access without explicit approval.

Do not expose service-role keys, secrets, JWTs, or private env values.

Document downstream effects in `OPEN_THREADS.md` or `DECISION_LOG.md` when the data contract changes.
